    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kipuka Abiyam Yudaya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alokaru a ŋolo a ŋitomon ka ŋikanikauni ipukat erwosit Yeroboam lokoku a Nebat Isirael, Kisyakini Abiyam akipu Yudaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kipuka iŋes Yudaya alo Yerusalem ŋikaru ŋiuni. Arae ekiro a toto keŋ Maaka nakoku ka Abisalom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Abiyam kitiya aronis daadaŋ ŋina sek etiyato papa keŋ pa eyookino etau keŋ aneni ke Ekapolon ka Akuj keŋ, pa ekoni etau keŋ ŋolo a Daudi a papaa keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kikote neni daŋ aŋuna a Daudi, abu Ekapolon Akuj keŋ kiturubak ŋituŋa a Daudi eyakasi Yerusalem aŋuna abunio kilunyokinia lokoku keŋ kipuka ka aŋuna abunio kituruworya Yerusalem akibois ŋina emam ituŋanan ereuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae ŋun aŋuna abunio Daudi toruwor ŋolo eyookino alokiŋaren Ekapolon, ido nyimyekina iŋes akiwuap adio a ŋakiciketa ke Ekapolon ŋirwa daadaŋ ŋulu ka akiyar keŋ, mati ŋuna ka atwanare a Uria bon a ŋolo arae Eitait. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Torubak ejie eyai kidiŋ Reoboam ŋirwa daadaŋ ŋulu ka akiyar ka Abiyam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋiticisyo ka Abiyam ŋuluce daadaŋ ka ŋuna daadaŋ etiyat iŋes, igiritae lokitaabo ŋolo a ŋakiro a ŋirwosi a Yudaya. Apotu Abiyam ka Reoboam torubakis ejiete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Abiyam totwana, ido aponi tonukae iŋes lotaun a Daudi. Abu nai lokoku keŋ Asa kilunyokin lokicoloŋ keŋ kipuka Yudaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kipuka Asa Yudaya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alokaru a ŋolo a ŋatomoniarei ipukat erwosit Yeroboam Isirael, kisyak Asa akipuka Yudaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kipuka iŋes Yudaya alo Yerusalem ŋikaru ŋatomoniomwon ke epei. Arae ekiro a toto keŋ Maaka nakoku ka Abisalom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Asa kitiya ŋuna eyookino alokiŋaren Ekapolon, lopite ŋolo abunio Daudi papaa keŋ kitiyaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu iŋes tolema ŋimalaae ka ŋamalaae anakiboisyo a ŋuna elipyata ŋituŋa alo Yudaya. Tolema iŋes nakujo ŋuna kepotu atapapaa keŋ kitiyaut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolema iŋes tari Maaka toto keŋ anarakau arwosit anerae, kebu kitiyau etorube a akuj aŋina enyaritae Asera. Abu Asa toyepak akuj ŋin kwap tosodi kicuny anauwat a ŋina a Kidiron. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai pa abu iŋes tolema ŋaduketa ŋuna aya nenimukur. Tari pa kelemarit ŋun, eyookino etau ka Asa aneni ke Ekapolon ŋirwa daadaŋ ŋulu ka akiyar keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Asa yau Kai ke Ekapolon ŋainakineta a papa keŋ ŋuna asegak ka ŋainakineta keŋ ke elope ŋuna asegak; ŋainakineta ŋuna ke esilipa, a egolid ka ŋiboro ŋulukimujet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Toriwo Yudaya ka Aram akitijiore Isirael",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu Asa ka Baasa erwosit ŋolo a Isirael torubakis ejiete ŋirwa daadaŋ ŋulu ka akiyar kec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Baasa erwosit ŋolo a Isirael kitipeiyo Yudaya kisyak akiduk Rama kojokon, aŋuna ka akiretakin ituŋanan ŋini ebuni aneni ka Asa, kori elosi neni ka Asa a erwosit a ŋolo a Yudaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun nai, abu Asa tolemu esilipa daadaŋ ka egolid ŋolo edoŋit lositowae ŋulu ka Akai ke Ekapolon ka lositowae ŋulu ka akai ke erwosit, inak ŋiboro ŋul neni a ŋiketiyak keŋ. Kiyakiya Asa ŋiketiyak keŋ ŋul neni a erwosit Ben-Adad a lokoku a Tabirimon a ŋolo arae lokoku ka Esion a ŋolo alo Aram. Eboi Ben-Adad alo Damasko apaki ŋin. Temasi ŋiketiyak ŋul neni a Ben-Adad abala Asa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Oriwo iyoŋ ka ayoŋ, lopite ŋolo ariitotor papa kaŋ ka papa kon; ekeyakikinit ayoŋ iyoŋ ŋainakineta ŋuna a esilipa ka egolid; toŋer tokona ariit ka Baasa, erwosit ŋolo a Isirael, ikotere iŋes eboŋori nyeketijik ayoŋ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiira Ben-Adad ŋakiro ka Asa a erwosit, ido kiyakiya ŋikarikok a ŋajorei keŋ akirem ŋitaunio ŋulu a Isirael. Toreu iŋes ŋitaunio lu: Ijon, Dan, Abel-Bes-Maaka ka akwap ŋina anyaritae Keneres daadaŋ ta akwap a Naputali daadaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani iirari Baasa ŋakiro ŋun, tojoŋo akiduk Rama, toboŋo kiboiyo Tirisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimok nai Asa ŋituŋa a Yudaya daadaŋ atemar emaikina ŋituŋa daadaŋ emam akimyekin tari idio, toloto kiwokut ŋamoru ka ŋakito alo Rama ŋuna sek adukio Baasa. Abu erwosit Asa kisitiya ŋamoru ka ŋakito ŋun adukio Geba ka Misipa, ŋitaunio ŋulu aya Benjamin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋiticisyo nai ka Asa ŋuluce daadaŋ, arwonu keŋ a daadaŋ ka ŋuna etiyat iŋes daadaŋ ta ŋitaunio daadaŋ ŋulu abu iŋes toduk, igiritae lokitaabo ŋolo a ŋakiro a ŋirwosi a Yudaya. Nai ani edoli ŋirwa ŋulu amojoŋia Asa, todyakakin ŋakejen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Totwana nai Asa, ido tonukae lotaun a Daudi a papaa keŋ, neni anukitae atapapaa keŋ. Abu lokoku keŋ Yeosapat kilunyokin lokicoloŋ keŋ kipuka Yudaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kipuka Nadab Isirael",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alokaru a ŋolo a ŋiarei ipukat Asa Yudaya, kisyak Nadab lokoku a Yeroboam akipuka Isirael. Kipuka Nadab Isirael ŋikaru ŋiarei bon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu iŋes kitiya ŋuna aronok alokiŋaren Ekapolon, kiwuap ŋuna etiyat papa keŋ ŋuna arikokinia Ŋisirael nasecit.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Baasa lokoku ka Aija a ŋolo alokabila ka Isakar totuk akiar Nadab, kitijik iŋes alo Gibeson alotaun a Ŋipilistin a ŋolo kepotu Nadab ka Ŋisirael daadaŋ kirikaut togolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aari Baasa Nadab alokaru a ŋolo a ŋiuni ipukat Asa Yudaya, ido abu Baasa kilunyokin lokicoloŋ a Nadab kipuka Isirael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aruwaor iŋes erwosit bon, abu toar ŋituŋa a ekal a Yeroboam daadaŋ. Mam ituŋanan a Yeroboam abu iŋes kimyek eyari, nai abu tomunya daadaŋ, ikwapei alimokinitere anakirot ke Ekapolon a ŋina alimuni Aija eketiyan ke Ekapolon ŋolo alo Silo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae ŋun aŋuna a ŋasecisya a Yeroboam ka aŋuna abunio iŋes torikokinia Ŋisirael nasecit ta aŋuna abunio iŋes kitoŋoya Ekapolon Akuj a Ŋisirael.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
